              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "text_nkBBhn": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>We rigorously test all our gear to meet the highest safety standards, providing robust defense. Our Shinguards offer superior shin and instep protection, allowing you to train with aggression and focus. Our Headgear provides crucial head and face defence, effectively absorbing powerful blows. We also offer specialized Taekwondo doboks and protective gear, perfectly designed for the unique demands of that discipline. For comprehensive protection, our No-gi and protective gear lineup covers all your needs. You can entirely rely on our Taekwondo doboks and protective gear to keep you safe and confident in every training session and competition. So, trust Antares Athletics; we give you strong protection so you can push your limits safely.<br/><br/></p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "none",
                "alignment": "left",
